Precision-preserving Qwen4exp pipeline and Q8 scheduling adapted from the
MIT-licensed halo-box/strix-llama.cpp snapshot
7a9196dad8b13b70fb3420886aadaf98fc09b849. The retired private graph patch
contributed the scoped Q8 prefetch and small MoE tiles now collected here.
No shadow weights, BF16/F16 matrix mode or residual downcast is included.

HC and narrow-row RMS fusions follow upstream's aligned float4 F32
reduction tree. Scalar or unsupported layouts fall back instead of silently
changing normalization order. Keep this compatibility when removing an
independent decode optimization.

